" Diff [1]   Files [2]   <repo>
"gdiff ┌Keys──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐hing  "
"┌Files│ j / k, ↑ / ↓    move (tree) or scroll (diff)             │─────┐"
"│  M a│ Tab             switch focus tree ↔ diff                 │     │"
"│     │ n / p           next / previous file                     │     │"
"│     │ ] / [           next / previous hunk                     │     │"
"│     │ Enter, → / ←    expand / collapse tree; Enter on a file f│     │"
"│     │ g / G, Ctrl-d/u top / bottom; half-page                  │     │"
"│     │ s               toggle unified / side-by-side            │     │"
"│     │ w               toggle word-level highlight              │     │"
"│     │ Space           mark file reviewed                       │     │"
"│     │ c               compare picker                           │     │"
"│     │ /               search in diff (n/N to navigate)         │     │"
"│     │ e               open file in $EDITOR                     │     │"
"│     │ r / a           refresh / toggle auto-refresh            │     │"
"│     │ ? / q           this help / quit                         │     │"
"└─────└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘─────┘"
